  "name": "Peerless Skill (College of Lore)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you make an Ability Check or Attack Roll and fail, you can expend one use of Bardic Inspiration; roll the Bardic Inspiration die, and add the number rolled to the d20, potentially turning a failure into a success. On a failure, the Bardic Inspiration isn't expended.</p>",
